interop 1 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/interop/1".

interop 1 is a public service.

interop 1 has the label "Art. 1(3) [Art. 76(4) of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542]".

interop 1 has the label "Industrial Emissions Portal".

interop 1 has the description "Cross-border environmental data exchange between MS and EU institutions.".

interop 1 has the description "Replaces the prescriptive obligation for the Commission to publish a periodic report on Member States’ data with a more flexible system allowing adaptive data review and optional publication. Digital relevance: modifies existing EU-level data-management and reporting processes.".

interop 1 has for "dcterms:identifier" the value "interop/1".

